  "install_text": "**Senstick Microclimate SMC30 2026**\n\nMicroclimate LoRaWAN sensor (2026 hardware revision). Collects temperature, relative humidity, and air pressure data.\n\n**Key features:**\n\n- LoRaWAN end-to-end encryption and data integrity protection\n- Monitors temperature, relative humidity, and air pressure\n- Built in accelerometer for movement and tampering detection\n- Long battery life\n- Updated hardware and firmware with its own payload decoder\n- Easily replaceable batteries\n- Can be configured remotely or locally with Senzemo app\n\nDASHBOARD: https://admin.tago.io/template/6a705a622a7e4d000b5c25a6?host=api.eu-w1.tago.io",
